  translations:
  - locale: en
    text: 'There is also support for Rich Text and Markdown. You can beautifully
      format your text in the comfortable Text Editor.


      - markdown list

      -
      <color=#00ffba>Colored text</color>

      - <u>Underline</u>, <s>strikethrough</s>...


      #
      Header 1

      ## Header 2


      <align=right>Alignment, **bold**, *italic*,
      <size=150%>big</size> and <size=50%>small</size> and other!</align>'
